          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ભાવતાલ કરવો",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ભાવતાલ કરવો — bhāvtāl karvo — \"to haggle, to bargain\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તે બજારમાં ભાવતાલ કરે છે. — te bajārmā̃ bhāvtāl kare che — \"She haggles in the market.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past તેણે ભાવતાલ કર્યો, teṇe bhāvtāl karyo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ભાવતાલ કરવો (bhāvtāl karvo) is built from bhāv, \"rate\" (CDIAL 9475), paired with tāl, and the light verb karvũ, \"to do\". The origin of tāl is not settled: CDIAL has no entry for the pair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for everyday life at A2."
            }
          ]
        },
